WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.990
More international patent applications come
from China than from any other country:

2
00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.730
73,718 in 2025.

3
00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:13.670
The USA files 52,617.

4
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:17.670
Japan, 47,922.

5
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.530
The top single filer is
Huawei, top since 2017.

6
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:25.810
Sixteen of the top 20
filers are ICT firms.

7
00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:30.630
So why does the USA still
earn far more from ideas?

8
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:35.550
In this mission, you'll see how TNCs
coordinate the value chains behind some 80

9
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:39.490
per cent of global trade,
by UNCTAD's estimate.

10
00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.070
Then you'll follow culture as it travels,

11
00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:46.190
carried by a drinks brand
enjoyed in over 200 countries.

12
00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:50.970
Your mission: explain why filing the most
patents has not made China the biggest

13
00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:52.430
earner from ideas.
